# Adapter SQL and Orval envelopes

Mirror of [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) “Adapter SQL and Orval envelopes”. Incident: [PR #303](https://github.com/adamhinckley/dc-inventory/pull/303).

- PGlite-test every new raw SQL adapter path (`VALUES` / `UNION` / branded uuid binds). In-memory use-case tests do not count.
- Cast uuid (and other non-text) binds in SQL fragments. Prefer `eq(column, brandedId)` when Drizzle can type it. Raw `` sql`${brandedId}` `` is text.
- Treat SQL rewrites (OR→VALUES, listAll→filtered SQL) as new queries — re-test the SQL.
- Staff tables: take `busy` / `listFailed` from `useDataTable` or use `DataTable.Root`. Ban `envelope === undefined && query.isError !== true`.
- Success = `isSuccessfulOrvalResponse` / status 2xx. Internal Orval `customFetch` does not throw on HTTP 500. Do not key loading on `!query.isError` alone.
